---
title: Boulevardier
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, whiskey]
source: Classic cocktail, number 19 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #mixing cup{}(with ice), pour @bourbon{1.25%fl_oz}, @Campari{1%fl_oz} and @sweet vermouth{1%fl_oz}. Stir well, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled) or over a large cube in a #rocks glass{}. Garnish with an @orange peel{1%twist}.

> A Negroni with whiskey in place of gin; rye makes it drier.
